# lgl-papercutter
===
 LGL Papercutter is a graphical wallpaper editor for Linux.  Resize, position, zoom, and crop wallpapers to match your desktop resolution. It supports detected displays, custom resolutions, portrait layouts, and ultrawide monitors.
